ercial customers. We earn an average management service fee of 15% from each job undertaken by our franchise partners."]},{"type":"p","children":["Our market-leading brands include Pirtek, Metro Rod and Filta. We employ approximately 600 people across the Group and there are over 3,000 people employed in the franchise community."]},{"type":"p","children":["For further information, visit www.franchisebrands.co.uk"]},{"type":"p","children":["Information required under the UK Market Abuse Regulation:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["1"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Details of the person discharging managerial responsibilities / person closely associated"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["a)"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Name"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Neil Miller"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["2"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Reason for the notification"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["a)"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Position/status"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Director and Chief Financial Officer"]},"\t\t\